SUMMARY:Montclair Literary Festival\, May 2 to 11\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the second full day of events at the 10th anniversary of the Montclair Literary Festival\, a vibrant showcase of books\, ideas and community running from Saturday May 2 through to Monday May 11\, 2026! \nFeatured authors include Xochitl Gonzalez\, Maria Semple\, Francine Prose\, Anand Gopal\, Luke Barr\, Cynthia D’Aprix Sweeney\, and more! \nAcross two full day of events\, you’ll find conversations on artificial intelligence\, politics\, French cooking\, music history\, biography\, debut fiction\, and poetry. With over 60 authors in 34 events\, there is something for everyone to enjoy. \nIn addition on May 9\, Montclair State University is hosting Express Yourself!\, a day of hands-on workshops and creative exploration in writing\, visual art\, music\, dance\, photography and theater. \nThe majority of events are FREE and open to all – no registration required\, making it easy to drop in and be inspired. \nAll details can be found on the Festival website here https://succeed2gether.org/mlf26/. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/montclair-literary-festival-may-2-to-11-2026-2/
LOCATION:Montclair State University Hall\, Montclair\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture,Community,Entertainment,Literature
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/MLF-26-FB-event-listing.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Literary Festival":MAILTO:montclairliteraryfestival@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
