SUMMARY:C3Workplace/C3Worx presents: From Vision to Results: How to Plan and Execute for Sustainable Growth
DESCRIPTION:Business leaders rarely lack ideas. The real challenge comes when they have to turn those ideas into consistent\, measurable execution. \nIn fact\, research shows:\n• 90% of organizations fail to execute their strategies effectively\n• 67% of well-formulated strategies fail because of poor execution\, not bad ideas \nBut…\n• Companies that pair clear planning with disciplined execution grow up to 30% faster and achieve measurably higher profitability than those operating without a structured plan \nJoin us on May 12th at 12 pm for a virtual session to learn a proven framework to move from vision to results—without overwhelming your team\, burning yourself out\, or endlessly re-planning. \nIn this session of our Business Growth Roundtable\, you’ll learn how to:\n• Identify the execution gaps quietly draining time and profit\n• Build a step-by-step success blueprint aligned to your priorities\n• Turn goals into implementation that your team can replicate\n• Use simple KPIs to drive accountability and ROI \nOrganizations with strong execution discipline outperform peers by up to 35% in profitability\, according to recent operational excellence studies. \nAre you ready to join them? \nReserve your spot and learn how growth really becomes reality.\nhttps://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/3817750487025/WN_cbjEUmsMTrCdIAmGQi3auw#/registration \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/c3workplace-c3worx-presents-from-vision-to-results-how-to-plan-and-execute-for-sustainable-growth/
