SUMMARY:Community Uplift 5K Run/Walk
DESCRIPTION:May 16\, 2026\n5K Run/Walk 10AM Start\nRain or Shine \nThe Omega Family Resource and Learning Center\n132 South Harrison St.\nEast Orange\, NJ 07018 \nParking:\nWe have a parking lot at 95 Evergreen Pl behind our building. If that is full\, there is street parking on Evergreen Pl. \nRegister by April 30th and you’re guaranteed to receive a free t-shirt on race day. After that\, we’ll do our best but can’t make any promises. \nAMENITIES\nLIVE / text / email results\nFREE finish line photos\nPersonalized bib if registered 3 weeks in advance \nAWARDS FOR 5K RUN\nTop 3 M/F Overall in the 5K Run* (10AM Start) \n*If you run in the incorrect wave you will be ineligible for awards. \nBENEFICIARY\nProceeds to benefit GECUF \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
